# Best 4K HDBaseT HDMI Extenders (2026)\n\nI searched current product listings and manufacturer specifications. These are my top picks for extending 4K HDMI over CAT6/CAT6a, from affordable home installations to professional AV systems.\n\n## Top 5 recommendations\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"OREI UHD-EXB330AUR-K HDBaseT HDMI extender transmitter receiver kit product\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n(Best overall value)\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn564775product9\",\"4K HDBaseT HDMI\u2122 Extender (ARC, LAN & KVM) - 330ft (cat6)-UH\u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$389.99\n\n4K60 4:4:4 up to 90m (295ft), USB KVM, ARC, LAN, IR and PoC. A versatile home theater or conference-room choice. \ue200cite\ue202turn564775search0\ue201\n\nOREI \u00b7 4.5/5 (15 reviews)\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"OREI EX-230UHD HDBaseT HDMI extender kit product transmitter receiver\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn564775product19\",\"4K HDBaseT HDMI\u2122 Extender (Loop) - 230ft (cat6)-EX-230UHD\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$149.99\n\nBest budget HDBaseT option\n\nUp to 230ft advertised range, IR, RS-232 and power over cable. Good for straightforward TV or projector installations.\n\nOREI \u00b7 4.9/5 (29 reviews)\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"OREI UHD-EXB350EAU-K HDBaseT 3.0 HDMI extender transmitter receiver product\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn564775product5\",\"Orei - 4K HDBaseT 3.0 HDMI\u2122 Extender (Loop, USB, eARC, LAN) \u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$399.99\n\nBest for eARC and USB\n\nHDBaseT 3.0, 4K60, USB KVM, eARC, LAN and HDMI loop output. Particularly useful for complex home AV setups.\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"AVPro Edge AC-EX70-444-KIT HDBaseT HDMI extender transmitter receiver\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"product\",\"AVPro Edge AC-EX70-444-KIT\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$1,462\n\nBest professional AV installation\n\n4K60 4:4:4 at up to 70m, 18Gbps bandwidth and advanced EDID management. A strong option for commercial installations. \ue200cite\ue202turn564775search4\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"AVPro Edge AC-EX100-444-KIT HDBaseT 3.0 HDMI extender product\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn564775product0\",\"AVPro Edge AC-EX100-444-KIT Ultra Slim 100 Meter 4K60 4:4:4,\u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$2,090.00\n\nBest premium long-distance system\n\nHDBaseT 3.0, 4K60 4:4:4 HDR, and up to 100m over CAT6. Designed for demanding professional AV deployments.\n\n## Important specifications to compare\n\n| Feature | What to look for |\n|--------|--------|\n| Resolution | 4K at 60Hz |\n| Color quality | 4:4:4 chroma |\n| Bandwidth | 18Gbps for full HDMI 2.0 |\n| Cable | CAT6a preferred for long runs |\n| HDR | HDR10 / Dolby Vision compatibility |\n| Power | PoC / PoH for easier installation |\n| Control | IR, RS-232, CEC |\n| Audio | ARC or eARC if required |\n\n**Important\\:** Some products advertised as \u201c4K60"}]}       

